        M4 3h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-8l-4.6 3.45A1 1 0 0 1 5.8 19.7V17H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Zm11 4.5a1.25 1.25 0 0 0-2.5 0V9h-1.5a1.25 1.25 0 0 0 0 2.5h1.5V13a1.25 1.25 0 0 0 2.5 0v-1.5H16a1.25 1.25 0 0 0 0-2.5h-1V7.5Z
